  10           5           8            7             8          1c        0            5
  11           4           9            7             8          1c        0            5
  12           5           9            7             8          1c        0            5
------------------ CIRCULAR BEAM CROSS-SECTION PROPERTIES -----------------------------
             8   NPropSets   - Number of structurally unique cross-sections
PropSetID     YoungE          ShearG          MatDens          XsecD           XsecT
  (-)         (N/m2)          (N/m2)          (kg/m3)           (m)             (m)
   1        2.00000e+11     8.00000e+10       7850.00          15.0000         0.1200
